          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "After writing numbers from 1 to 100, Dinesh wondered how many times he would have written the digit ‘7’!"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.228,
            0.519,
            0.32
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Among the numbers 1–100, how many times will the digit ‘7’ occur? Among the numbers 1–1000, how many times will the digit ‘7’ occur?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
